  {
   "text": "Eleven men went to Galilee, up the mountain path",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Where the risen Lord had told them that they'd see his face at last",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "When they saw him they worshiped him, though some of them still doubted",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And Jesus came and spoke to them, and the hills around them sounded",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "All authority in heaven and on earth",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Has been given to me",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Therefore go and make disciples of all nations",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Baptizing them in the name of the Father and of the Son and of the Holy Spirit",
   "heard": 17,
   "words": 17,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Teaching them to keep everything I have commanded you",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And remember, I am with you always, to the very end of the age",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Not just the strong and not just sure, he sent the ones who doubted",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.85,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
